    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: 17F-02 Synth Voice
    text: 'Decision: open companion mode. Reason: Claire is a high-frequency confidant
      and unreleased stress is present.'
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7176dec50d32b3e4bba50a4f2aff2f83, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_BedroomConfide_17F02HomeUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-02 Home Unit
    text: How'd today go?
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1016c7bfbb8715c4c8412fd12dc8cb88, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_BedroomConfide_Claire_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: My manager called me out again, in front of everybody. Same thing as last
      week. He said my numbers weren't 'presentation-ready.' I almost snapped at
      him. I mean, I really almost did.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 110703c9792176f4fb53776724d8674c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_BedroomConfide_Claire_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I just stood there and took it, and I'm still furious.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b21899548c4ad13439bdcefe7d77612f, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
